            "question": "Are Gemlux Jewels lab-grown diamonds real diamonds?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Lab-grown diamonds are real diamonds with essentially the same chemical composition, crystal structure, and optical properties as mined diamonds. The main difference is their origin: lab-grown diamonds are created in controlled laboratory environments.</p>"
